{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":75,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"To the chief Musician, Al-taschith, A Psalm or Song of Asaph.","tok":[{"t":"To the chief "},{"t":"Musician","s":["H5329"],"a":[0]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Al-taschith","s":["H0516"],"a":[1]},{"t":", A "},{"t":"Psalm","s":["H4210"],"a":[3]},{"t":" or "},{"t":"Song","s":["H7892"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Asaph","s":["H0623"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":1,"text":"Unto thee, O God, do we give thanks, unto thee do we give thanks: for that thy name is near thy wondrous works declare.","tok":[{"t":"Unto thee, O "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[2]},{"t":", do we give "},{"t":"thanks","s":["H3034"],"a":[0]},{"t":", unto thee do we give "},{"t":"thanks","s":["H3034"],"a":[3]},{"t":": for that thy "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"near","s":["H7138"],"a":[4]},{"t":" thy wondrous "},{"t":"works","s":["H6381"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"declare","s":["H5608"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"When I shall receive the congregation I will judge uprightly.","tok":[{"t":"When I shall "},{"t":"receive","s":["H3947"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"congregation","s":["H4150"],"a":[2]},{"t":" I will "},{"t":"judge","s":["H8199"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"uprightly","s":["H4339"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"The earth and all the inhabitants thereof are dissolved: I bear up the pillars of it. Selah.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and all the "},{"t":"inhabitants","s":["H3427"],"a":[3]},{"t":" thereof are "},{"t":"dissolved","s":["H4127"],"a":[0]},{"t":": I bear "},{"t":"up","s":["H8505"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"pillars","s":["H5982"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of it. "},{"t":"Selah","s":["H5542"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"I said unto the fools, Deal not foolishly: and to the wicked, Lift not up the horn:","tok":[{"t":"I "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" unto the "},{"t":"fools","s":["H1984"],"a":[1]},{"t":", Deal not "},{"t":"foolishly","s":["H1984"],"a":[3]},{"t":": and to the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[4]},{"t":", Lift not "},{"t":"up","s":["H7311"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"horn","s":["H7161"],"a":[7]},{"t":":"}]},{"n":5,"text":"Lift not up your horn on high: speak not with a stiff neck.","tok":[{"t":"Lift not "},{"t":"up","s":["H7311"],"a":[1]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"horn","s":["H7161"],"a":[3]},{"t":" on "},{"t":"high","s":["H4791"],"a":[2]},{"t":": "},{"t":"speak","s":["H1696"],"a":[4]},{"t":" not with a "},{"t":"stiff","s":["H6277"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"neck","s":["H6677"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"For promotion cometh neither from the east, nor from the west, nor from the south.","tok":[{"t":"For "},{"t":"promotion","s":["H7311"],"a":[6]},{"t":" cometh neither from the "},{"t":"east","s":["H4161"],"a":[2]},{"t":", nor from the "},{"t":"west","s":["H4628"],"a":[3]},{"t":", nor from the "},{"t":"south","s":["H4057"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"But God is the judge: he putteth down one, and setteth up another.","tok":[{"t":"But "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is the "},{"t":"judge","s":["H8199"],"a":[2]},{"t":": he putteth "},{"t":"down","s":["H8213"],"a":[4]},{"t":" one, and setteth "},{"t":"up","s":["H7311"],"a":[6]},{"t":" another."}]},{"n":8,"text":"For in the hand of the LORD there is a cup, and the wine is red; it is full of mixture; and he poureth out of the same: but the dregs thereof, all the wicked of the earth shall wring them out, and drink them.","tok":[{"t":"For in the "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" there is a "},{"t":"cup","s":["H3563"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and the "},{"t":"wine","s":["H3196"],"a":[4]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"red","s":["H2560"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; it is "},{"t":"full","s":["H4392"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"mixture","s":["H4538"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; and he poureth "},{"t":"out","s":["H5064"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"same","s":["H2088"],"a":[9]},{"t":": but the "},{"t":"dregs","s":["H8105"],"